BODIES = {
    "building-materials": "<section class=\"hero wide hero-photo wall-construction\"> <div class=\"hero-glow\"></div> <div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"hero-eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Building Materials</div>\n<h1 class=\"in\">The materials every built asset starts from.</h1>\n<p class=\"hero-sub\">Building materials includes the organizations that extract, process, produce and supply the materials incorporated into buildings and infrastructure, from raw inputs to delivery at the point of use.</p>\n<p class=\"hero-body\">Producers run continuous plants against volatile inputs and commercial commitments that change week to week. TwoSuns connects the production, quality, energy, maintenance and commercial context that those decisions depend on, and keeps a record of what was decided.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn-cta\" href=\"discuss.html?ask=Discuss+Your+Needs\">Discuss Your Needs</a><a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"platform.html\">Explore the Platform</a></div>\n</div> </section>\n<div class=\"sun-divider\"></div>\n\n<section style=\"padding:88px 0 40px;\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Where it sits</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Six parts of building materials</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Material passes through several organizations, and often several plants, before it reaches a project.</p> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-l bg-materials area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a1);\">1</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Extraction and Raw Materials</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Organizations that source the natural and recovered inputs materials are made from.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Quarrying and aggregates</li><li>Sand, clay and industrial minerals</li><li>Timber and forest products</li><li>Metals and ores</li><li>Recycled and secondary materials</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-r bg-operations area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a2);\">2</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Process Production</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Continuous and batch plants that convert raw inputs into materials.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Cement and binders</li><li>Steel and metals</li><li>Glass</li><li>Gypsum and lime</li><li>Chemicals, coatings and admixtures</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-l bg-construction area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a3);\">3</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Concrete and Manufactured Materials</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Producers that turn materials into ready-to-use products.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Ready-mix concrete</li><li>Precast and concrete products</li><li>Masonry, brick and block</li><li>Asphalt and paving materials</li><li>Insulation, boards and panels</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-r bg-owners area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a4);\">4</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Plant Operations and Assets</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">The equipment and operating activity that keep production running.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Kilns, mills, furnaces and process lines</li><li>Quarry and mobile equipment</li><li>Energy and fuel supply</li><li>Maintenance, repair and reliability</li><li>Plant performance monitoring</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-l bg-distribution area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a5);\">5</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Distribution and Supply</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Networks that move heavy, bulky material to regional markets.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Bulk terminals and depots</li><li>Distributors and builders&#x27; merchants</li><li>Dealer and trade networks</li><li>Transportation and haulage</li><li>Inventory and yard management</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-r bg-institutions area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a6);\">6</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Quality, Standards and Compliance</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Requirements that material and plant must meet.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Product testing and quality control</li><li>Standards and certification</li><li>Environmental permits and reporting</li><li>Health and safety requirements</li><li>Technical specifications and declarations</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"band-alt\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Lifecycle</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">The materials lifecycle connects them</h2> <p class=\"lede\">Material moves through demand, extraction, processing, production, quality, storage, dispatch, delivery and use, and increasingly back into production through recovery and reuse.</p> <div class=\"ecl\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1280 800\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The materials lifecycle at the centre, with the six parts of the industry around it.\"><defs> <radialGradient id=\"eg\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFFDF0\"></stop><stop offset=\".34\" stop-color=\"#F6E4A4\"></stop> <stop offset=\".72\" stop-color=\"#DFC15C\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#CC9900\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"eo\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFF4E8\"></stop><stop offset=\".32\" stop-color=\"#FFB077\"></stop> <stop offset=\".70\" stop-color=\"#F2762A\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#E0641E\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"ec\"><stop offset=\".55\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,.20)\"></stop> <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,0)\"></stop></radialGradient> <filter id=\"eng\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"> <feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\"0.9\" numOctaves=\"4\" stitchTiles=\"stitch\"></feTurbulence> <feColorMatrix type=\"saturate\" values=\"0\"></feColorMatrix></filter> <clipPath id=\"el\"><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\"></circle></clipPath> </defs><circle cx=\"640\" cy=\"366\" r=\"420\" fill=\"url(#ec)\"></circle><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#eg)\"></circle><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#eo)\" opacity=\".9\"></circle><g clip-path=\"url(#el)\"><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"#FFFBF0\" opacity=\".96\"></circle></g><g clip-path=\"url(#el)\"><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFF6DC\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\".9\"></circle></g><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.45)\"></circle><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(196,82,19,.45)\"></circle><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"231\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"231\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Demand</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"261\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"261\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Extraction</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"291\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"291\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Processing</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"321\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"321\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Production</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"351\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"351\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Quality</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"381\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"381\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Storage</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"411\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"411\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Dispatch</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"441\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"441\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Delivery</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"471\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"471\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Use</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"501\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"501\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Recovery</title></line><line x1=\"351\" y1=\"231\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#E0641E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"231\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#E0641E\"></circle><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"231\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E0641E\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"308\" y1=\"366\" x2=\"246\" y2=\"366\" stroke=\"#CC9900\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"366\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#CC9900\"></circle><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"366\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#CC9900\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"351\" y1=\"501\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"537\" stroke=\"#C45213\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"501\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#C45213\"></circle><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"501\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C45213\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"929\" y1=\"231\" x2=\"980\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#B07E00\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"231\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B07E00\"></circle><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"231\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B07E00\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"972\" y1=\"366\" x2=\"1034\" y2=\"366\" stroke=\"#D9822B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"972\" cy=\"366\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#D9822B\"></circle><circle cx=\"972\" cy=\"366\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D9822B\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"929\" y1=\"501\" x2=\"980\" y2=\"537\" stroke=\"#8C6500\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"501\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C6500\"></circle><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"501\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8C6500\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><rect width=\"1280\" height=\"800\" filter=\"url(#eng)\" opacity=\".055\"></rect></svg><div class=\"ecl-core\" style=\"top:45.75%;\"> <div class=\"k\">Where they overlap</div> <div class=\"v\">The materials lifecycle</div> <div class=\"c\">Ten stages</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"right:77.66%;top:24.38%;text-align:right;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#E0641E;\">01</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#E0641E;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Extraction and Raw Materials</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"right:81.88%;top:45.75%;text-align:right;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#CC9900;\">02</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#CC9900;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Process Production</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"right:77.66%;top:67.12%;text-align:right;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#C45213;\">03</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#C45213;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Concrete and Manufactured Materials</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"left:77.66%;top:24.38%;text-align:left;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#B07E00;\">04</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#B07E00;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Plant Operations and Assets</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"left:81.88%;top:45.75%;text-align:left;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#D9822B;\">05</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#D9822B;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Distribution and Supply</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"left:77.66%;top:67.12%;text-align:left;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#8C6500;\">06</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#8C6500;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Quality, Standards and Compliance</div> </div></div> <div class=\"ecl-fallback\"><div class=\"ecl-mini\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1280 800\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs> <radialGradient id=\"egm\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFFDF0\"></stop><stop offset=\".34\" stop-color=\"#F6E4A4\"></stop> <stop offset=\".72\" stop-color=\"#DFC15C\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#CC9900\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"eom\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFF4E8\"></stop><stop offset=\".32\" stop-color=\"#FFB077\"></stop> <stop offset=\".70\" stop-color=\"#F2762A\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#E0641E\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"ecm\"><stop offset=\".55\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,.20)\"></stop> <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,0)\"></stop></radialGradient> <filter id=\"engm\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"> <feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\"0.9\" numOctaves=\"4\" stitchTiles=\"stitch\"></feTurbulence> <feColorMatrix type=\"saturate\" values=\"0\"></feColorMatrix></filter> <clipPath id=\"elm\"><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\"></circle></clipPath> </defs> <circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#egm)\"></circle> <circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#eom)\" opacity=\".9\"></circle> <g clip-path=\"url(#elm)\"><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"#FFFBF0\" opacity=\".96\"></circle></g> </svg></div><ul class=\"ecl-list\"><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#E0641E;\">1</span><span class=\"t\">Extraction and Raw Materials</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#CC9900;\">2</span><span class=\"t\">Process Production</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#C45213;\">3</span><span class=\"t\">Concrete and Manufactured Materials</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#B07E00;\">4</span><span class=\"t\">Plant Operations and Assets</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#D9822B;\">5</span><span class=\"t\">Distribution and Supply</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#8C6500;\">6</span><span class=\"t\">Quality, Standards and Compliance</span></li></ul></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Shared conditions</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Conditions shared across building materials</h2> <div class=\"grid2\"><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Capital-intensive plants operating continuously or in long campaigns</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Energy, fuel and raw material costs that move with markets</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Heavy, bulky products serving regional markets</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Demand linked to construction and infrastructure activity</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Quality set by standards and customer specification</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Environmental and regulatory obligations tied to each plant</p></div></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"band-warm\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Connected work</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Follow the material from plant to project</h2> <p class=\"lede\">A change in energy cost or equipment availability affects unit cost, output and what can be committed to customers. A shift in construction demand changes dispatch plans, inventory and pricing. TwoSuns connects these decisions and keeps a record of what was decided.</p> <div class=\"grid4\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #9A7209;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#9A7209;\">Commercial</div><h3>Horizon</h3><p>Market position, customer demand, pricing and the commercial commitments that set what the plant is asked to produce.</p></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #C45213;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#C45213;\">Operational</div><h3>Pulse</h3><p>Production performance, quality, energy intensity, maintenance and the supply coordination that determines whether those commitments are met.</p></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #1E1A14;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#1E1A14;\">Foundation</div><h3>Core</h3><p>Plants, assets, products, customers and decisions held in one governed context.</p></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #B8860B;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#B8860B;\">Companion</div><h3>Ray</h3><p>Briefings, analysis and task support for commercial, plant and supply teams.</p></div></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">In practice</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Representative workflows</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Configured from the same capabilities, around the work this industry actually runs.</p> <div class=\"grid2\"><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Manufacturing economics and production performance</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-manufacturing-economics-and-production-performance\">Read the workflow</a></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Asset operations, maintenance and reliability</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-asset-operations-maintenance-and-reliability\">Read the workflow</a></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Procurement, inventory and supplier coordination</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-procurement-inventory-and-supplier-coordination\">Read the workflow</a></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Regulatory, quality and compliance workflows</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-regulatory-quality-and-compliance-workflows\">Read the workflow</a></div></div> <a class=\"ev-more more-link\" href=\"use-cases.html\">Explore all use cases</a>  </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"band-alt\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Industries</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Connected across the built industry</h2> <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"card\"> <p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;\">Construction and Infrastructure</p> <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;\">Projects are won on estimates, delivered through changing conditions and judged long after handover.</p> <a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"construction.html\">Explore this industry</a> </div><div class=\"card\"> <p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;\">Manufacturing</p> <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;\">Manufacturers supplying the built industry carry the same pressures as their customers, on shorter cycles.</p> <a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"manufacturing.html\">Explore this industry</a> </div><div class=\"card\"> <p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;\">All Industries</p> <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;\">The three sectors we work in, and the six operating areas behind them.</p> <a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"industries.html\">See all industries</a> </div></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"cta-band\"> <div class=\"container\"> <h2>Start from your part of building materials</h2> <p>Tell us where your organization sits in building materials and the workflow you want to advance.</p> <div class=\"cta-actions\"><a class=\"btn-cta\" href=\"discuss.html?ask=Discuss+Your+Needs\">Discuss Your Needs</a> <a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"use-cases.html\">Explore Use Cases</a></div> </div> </section>",
    "construction": "<section class=\"hero wide hero-photo wall-construction\"> <div class=\"hero-glow\"></div> <div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"hero-eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Construction and Infrastructure</div>\n<h1 class=\"in\">One project outcome, delivered by many organizations.</h1>\n<p class=\"hero-sub\">Construction and infrastructure include the owners, contractors, designers, advisers and suppliers that plan, pursue, deliver and hand over buildings, civil works and infrastructure.</p>\n<p class=\"hero-body\">Projects are won on estimates, delivered through changing conditions and judged long after handover. TwoSuns connects the scope, resources, suppliers, documents and progress that a project depends on, so the reasoning behind a decision survives the people who made it.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn-cta\" href=\"discuss.html?ask=Discuss+Your+Needs\">Discuss Your Needs</a><a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"platform.html\">Explore the Platform</a></div>\n</div> </section>\n<div class=\"sun-divider\"></div>\n\n<section style=\"padding:88px 0 40px;\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Where it sits</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Six parts of construction and infrastructure</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Every project brings these organizations together, often for the first time and under a single contract structure.</p> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-l bg-owners area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a1);\">1</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Owners, Developers and Clients</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Organizations that initiate, fund and accept the work.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Private developers and owners</li><li>Public agencies and infrastructure authorities</li><li>Corporate and industrial clients</li><li>Program and portfolio sponsors</li><li>Operators receiving completed assets</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-r bg-construction area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a2);\">2</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">General Contractors and Design-Builders</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Organizations that take responsibility for delivering the work.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>General contractors</li><li>Design-build and EPC contractors</li><li>Construction managers</li><li>Joint ventures and consortia</li><li>Developer-builders</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-l bg-operations area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a3);\">3</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Trade and Specialist Contractors</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Organizations that perform defined scopes within the work.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Civil, structural and earthworks</li><li>Mechanical, electrical and plumbing</li><li>Envelope, finishes and interiors</li><li>Specialist systems and installations</li><li>Temporary works, equipment and plant</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-r bg-institutions area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a4);\">4</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Design, Engineering and Advisory</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Professionals who define what is built and how it is delivered.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Architects and designers</li><li>Civil, structural and building services engineers</li><li>Technical and specialist consultants</li><li>Cost, project and program managers</li><li>Legal, financial and procurement advisers</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-l bg-distribution area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a5);\">5</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Supply and Site Logistics</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Networks that bring materials, equipment and labor to the work.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Materials and product suppliers</li><li>Equipment rental and plant hire</li><li>Distribution and delivery</li><li>Labor and workforce providers</li><li>Site logistics and temporary facilities</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-r bg-materials area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a6);\">6</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Assurance and Approvals</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Organizations that set requirements and confirm the work meets them.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Permitting and planning authorities</li><li>Testing and inspection services</li><li>Surveying and quantity surveying</li><li>Health, safety and environmental oversight</li><li>Commissioning, certification and handover</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"band-alt\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Lifecycle</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">The project lifecycle connects them</h2> <p class=\"lede\">A project moves through opportunity, pursuit, estimating, award, planning, procurement, construction, commissioning, handover and closeout. The record of each stage is carried into the next.</p> <div class=\"ecl\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1280 800\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The project lifecycle at the centre, with the six parts of the industry around it.\"><defs> <radialGradient id=\"eg\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFFDF0\"></stop><stop offset=\".34\" stop-color=\"#F6E4A4\"></stop> <stop offset=\".72\" stop-color=\"#DFC15C\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#CC9900\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"eo\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFF4E8\"></stop><stop offset=\".32\" stop-color=\"#FFB077\"></stop> <stop offset=\".70\" stop-color=\"#F2762A\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#E0641E\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"ec\"><stop offset=\".55\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,.20)\"></stop> <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,0)\"></stop></radialGradient> <filter id=\"eng\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"> <feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\"0.9\" numOctaves=\"4\" stitchTiles=\"stitch\"></feTurbulence> <feColorMatrix type=\"saturate\" values=\"0\"></feColorMatrix></filter> <clipPath id=\"el\"><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\"></circle></clipPath> </defs><circle cx=\"640\" cy=\"366\" r=\"420\" fill=\"url(#ec)\"></circle><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#eg)\"></circle><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#eo)\" opacity=\".9\"></circle><g clip-path=\"url(#el)\"><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"#FFFBF0\" opacity=\".96\"></circle></g><g clip-path=\"url(#el)\"><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFF6DC\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\".9\"></circle></g><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.45)\"></circle><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(196,82,19,.45)\"></circle><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"231\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"231\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Opportunity</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"261\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"261\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Pursuit</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"291\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"291\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Estimating</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"321\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"321\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Award</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"351\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"351\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Planning</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"381\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"381\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Procurement</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"411\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"411\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Construction</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"441\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"441\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Commissioning</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"471\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"471\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Handover</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"501\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"501\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Closeout</title></line><line x1=\"351\" y1=\"231\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#E0641E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"231\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#E0641E\"></circle><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"231\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E0641E\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"308\" y1=\"366\" x2=\"246\" y2=\"366\" stroke=\"#CC9900\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"366\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#CC9900\"></circle><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"366\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#CC9900\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"351\" y1=\"501\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"537\" stroke=\"#C45213\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"501\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#C45213\"></circle><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"501\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C45213\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"929\" y1=\"231\" x2=\"980\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#B07E00\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"231\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B07E00\"></circle><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"231\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B07E00\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"972\" y1=\"366\" x2=\"1034\" y2=\"366\" stroke=\"#D9822B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"972\" cy=\"366\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#D9822B\"></circle><circle cx=\"972\" cy=\"366\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D9822B\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"929\" y1=\"501\" x2=\"980\" y2=\"537\" stroke=\"#8C6500\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"501\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C6500\"></circle><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"501\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8C6500\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><rect width=\"1280\" height=\"800\" filter=\"url(#eng)\" opacity=\".055\"></rect></svg><div class=\"ecl-core\" style=\"top:45.75%;\"> <div class=\"k\">Where they overlap</div> <div class=\"v\">The project lifecycle</div> <div class=\"c\">Ten stages</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"right:77.66%;top:24.38%;text-align:right;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#E0641E;\">01</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#E0641E;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Owners, Developers and Clients</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"right:81.88%;top:45.75%;text-align:right;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#CC9900;\">02</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#CC9900;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">General Contractors and Design-Builders</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"right:77.66%;top:67.12%;text-align:right;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#C45213;\">03</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#C45213;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Trade and Specialist Contractors</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"left:77.66%;top:24.38%;text-align:left;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#B07E00;\">04</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#B07E00;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Design, Engineering and Advisory</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"left:81.88%;top:45.75%;text-align:left;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#D9822B;\">05</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#D9822B;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Supply and Site Logistics</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"left:77.66%;top:67.12%;text-align:left;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#8C6500;\">06</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#8C6500;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Assurance and Approvals</div> </div></div> <div class=\"ecl-fallback\"><div class=\"ecl-mini\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1280 800\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs> <radialGradient id=\"egm\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFFDF0\"></stop><stop offset=\".34\" stop-color=\"#F6E4A4\"></stop> <stop offset=\".72\" stop-color=\"#DFC15C\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#CC9900\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"eom\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFF4E8\"></stop><stop offset=\".32\" stop-color=\"#FFB077\"></stop> <stop offset=\".70\" stop-color=\"#F2762A\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#E0641E\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"ecm\"><stop offset=\".55\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,.20)\"></stop> <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,0)\"></stop></radialGradient> <filter id=\"engm\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"> <feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\"0.9\" numOctaves=\"4\" stitchTiles=\"stitch\"></feTurbulence> <feColorMatrix type=\"saturate\" values=\"0\"></feColorMatrix></filter> <clipPath id=\"elm\"><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\"></circle></clipPath> </defs> <circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#egm)\"></circle> <circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#eom)\" opacity=\".9\"></circle> <g clip-path=\"url(#elm)\"><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"#FFFBF0\" opacity=\".96\"></circle></g> </svg></div><ul class=\"ecl-list\"><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#E0641E;\">1</span><span class=\"t\">Owners, Developers and Clients</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#CC9900;\">2</span><span class=\"t\">General Contractors and Design-Builders</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#C45213;\">3</span><span class=\"t\">Trade and Specialist Contractors</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#B07E00;\">4</span><span class=\"t\">Design, Engineering and Advisory</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#D9822B;\">5</span><span class=\"t\">Supply and Site Logistics</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#8C6500;\">6</span><span class=\"t\">Assurance and Approvals</span></li></ul></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Shared conditions</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Conditions shared across construction and infrastructure</h2> <div class=\"grid2\"><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Each project a unique scope, site, contract and team</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Many organizations contributing to one delivery outcome</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Margins set at estimate and tested through delivery</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Scope, design and site conditions that change after award</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Long supply chains for materials, equipment and labor</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Documents, approvals and variations accumulating across the project</p></div></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"band-warm\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Connected work</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Follow the work from pursuit to handover</h2> <p class=\"lede\">A decision in one part of a project reaches the others. A revised quantity changes the estimate, the procurement plan and the schedule. A late delivery affects trade sequencing, cost and the client relationship. TwoSuns keeps those connections visible across the organizations involved.</p> <div class=\"grid4\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #9A7209;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#9A7209;\">Commercial</div><h3>Horizon</h3><p>Pipeline, tenders, proposals and the client relationships that decide which work is pursued and on what terms.</p></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #C45213;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#C45213;\">Operational</div><h3>Pulse</h3><p>Scope, schedule, resources, procurement and progress across the work that has been won, with the document trail attached.</p></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #1E1A14;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#1E1A14;\">Foundation</div><h3>Core</h3><p>Projects, contracts, documents, roles and decisions held in one governed context.</p></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #B8860B;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#B8860B;\">Companion</div><h3>Ray</h3><p>Briefings, document search and task support for commercial, project and site teams.</p></div></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">In practice</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Representative workflows</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Configured from the same capabilities, around the work this industry actually runs.</p> <div class=\"grid2\"><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Project planning, resources and progress</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-project-planning-resources-and-progress\">Read the workflow</a></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Estimating, quantity take-offs and materials</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-estimating-quantity-take-offs-and-materials\">Read the workflow</a></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Accounts, opportunities, tenders and proposals</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-accounts-opportunities-tenders-and-proposals\">Read the workflow</a></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Document intelligence and organizational knowledge</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-document-intelligence-and-organizational-knowledge\">Read the workflow</a></div></div> <a class=\"ev-more more-link\" href=\"use-cases.html\">Explore all use cases</a>  </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"band-alt\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Industries</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Connected across the built industry</h2> <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"card\"> <p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;\">Building Materials</p> <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;\">Producers run continuous plants against volatile inputs and commercial commitments that change week to week.</p> <a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"building-materials.html\">Explore this industry</a> </div><div class=\"card\"> <p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;\">Manufacturing</p> <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;\">Manufacturers supplying the built industry carry the same pressures as their customers, on shorter cycles.</p> <a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"manufacturing.html\">Explore this industry</a> </div><div class=\"card\"> <p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;\">All Industries</p> <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;\">The three sectors we work in, and the six operating areas behind them.</p> <a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"industries.html\">See all industries</a> </div></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"cta-band\"> <div class=\"container\"> <h2>Start from your part of the project</h2> <p>Tell us where your organization sits in construction and infrastructure and the workflow you want to advance.</p> <div class=\"cta-actions\"><a class=\"btn-cta\" href=\"discuss.html?ask=Discuss+Your+Needs\">Discuss Your Needs</a> <a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"use-cases.html\">Explore Use Cases</a></div> </div> </section>",
    "manufacturing": "<section class=\"hero wide hero-photo wall-construction\"> <div class=\"hero-glow\"></div> <div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"hero-eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Manufacturing</div>\n<h1 class=\"in\">The products, equipment and systems built assets depend on.</h1>\n<p class=\"hero-sub\">Manufacturing for the built industry includes the organizations that design, source, produce, assemble and support the products, equipment and systems incorporated into buildings and infrastructure.</p>\n<p class=\"hero-body\">Manufacturers supplying the built industry carry the same pressures as their customers, on shorter cycles. TwoSuns connects production performance, asset reliability, procurement and the commercial picture, so cost, capacity and commitment are read against each other rather than in separate systems.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn-cta\" href=\"discuss.html?ask=Discuss+Your+Needs\">Discuss Your Needs</a><a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"platform.html\">Explore the Platform</a></div>\n</div> </section>\n<div class=\"sun-divider\"></div>\n\n<section style=\"padding:88px 0 40px;\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Where it sits</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Six parts of manufacturing for the built industry</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Manufacturers range from high-volume product lines to engineered systems made for a single asset.</p> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-l bg-materials area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a1);\">1</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Building Products and Assemblies</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Products that form the structure, envelope and interior of built assets.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Structural and framing products</li><li>Envelope, roofing and cladding</li><li>Windows, doors and glazing</li><li>Interior finishes and fit-out</li><li>Fixtures and fittings</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-r bg-operations area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a2);\">2</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Equipment, Machinery and Controls</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Equipment that powers, moves, conditions and controls built assets.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Construction and material-handling equipment</li><li>Mechanical and HVAC equipment</li><li>Electrical and power distribution</li><li>Controls, sensors and automation</li><li>Elevators, conveyors and access systems</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-l bg-institutions area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a3);\">3</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Engineered and Specialized Systems</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Systems designed or configured for a specific asset or use.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Fire, life-safety and security systems</li><li>Water, wastewater and process systems</li><li>Energy generation and storage</li><li>Facade and specialist building systems</li><li>Custom-engineered components</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-r bg-construction area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a4);\">4</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Off-Site and Industrialized Construction</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Buildings and components produced in a factory and installed on site.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Modular and volumetric units</li><li>Panelized and prefabricated systems</li><li>Precast and fabricated components</li><li>Product platforms and kits of parts</li><li>Factory-to-site logistics</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-l bg-distribution area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a5);\">5</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Sourcing, Supply and Fulfillment</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">The flow of inputs into production and products out to customers.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Raw material and component sourcing</li><li>Supplier and contract manufacturing</li><li>Inventory and warehousing</li><li>Distribution and dealer networks</li><li>Order fulfillment and delivery</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"imgsec imgsec-r bg-owners area-sec\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"sec-split\"> <span class=\"card-num\" style=\"background:var(--a6);\">6</span> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Product Support and Aftermarket</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">The service that continues after a product is installed.</p> <ul class=\"tick\"><li>Installation and commissioning support</li><li>Warranty and service</li><li>Spare parts and replacement</li><li>Technical documentation and training</li><li>Upgrades, refurbishment and end of life</li></ul> </div> </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"band-alt\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Lifecycle</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">The product lifecycle connects them</h2> <p class=\"lede\">A product moves through demand, specification, design, sourcing, production, quality, distribution, installation, service and renewal, often across many projects at the same time.</p> <div class=\"ecl\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1280 800\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The product lifecycle at the centre, with the six parts of the industry around it.\"><defs> <radialGradient id=\"eg\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFFDF0\"></stop><stop offset=\".34\" stop-color=\"#F6E4A4\"></stop> <stop offset=\".72\" stop-color=\"#DFC15C\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#CC9900\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"eo\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFF4E8\"></stop><stop offset=\".32\" stop-color=\"#FFB077\"></stop> <stop offset=\".70\" stop-color=\"#F2762A\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#E0641E\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"ec\"><stop offset=\".55\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,.20)\"></stop> <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,0)\"></stop></radialGradient> <filter id=\"eng\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"> <feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\"0.9\" numOctaves=\"4\" stitchTiles=\"stitch\"></feTurbulence> <feColorMatrix type=\"saturate\" values=\"0\"></feColorMatrix></filter> <clipPath id=\"el\"><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\"></circle></clipPath> </defs><circle cx=\"640\" cy=\"366\" r=\"420\" fill=\"url(#ec)\"></circle><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#eg)\"></circle><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#eo)\" opacity=\".9\"></circle><g clip-path=\"url(#el)\"><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"#FFFBF0\" opacity=\".96\"></circle></g><g clip-path=\"url(#el)\"><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFF6DC\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\".9\"></circle></g><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.45)\"></circle><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(196,82,19,.45)\"></circle><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"231\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"231\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Demand</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"261\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"261\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Specification</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"291\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"291\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Design</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"321\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"321\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Sourcing</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"351\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"351\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Production</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"381\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"381\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Quality</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"411\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"411\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Distribution</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"441\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"441\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Installation</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"471\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"471\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Service</title></line><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"501\" x2=\"666\" y2=\"501\" stroke=\"rgba(140,101,0,.5)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><title>Renewal</title></line><line x1=\"351\" y1=\"231\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#E0641E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"231\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#E0641E\"></circle><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"231\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E0641E\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"308\" y1=\"366\" x2=\"246\" y2=\"366\" stroke=\"#CC9900\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"366\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#CC9900\"></circle><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"366\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#CC9900\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"351\" y1=\"501\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"537\" stroke=\"#C45213\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"501\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#C45213\"></circle><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"501\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C45213\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"929\" y1=\"231\" x2=\"980\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#B07E00\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"231\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B07E00\"></circle><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"231\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B07E00\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"972\" y1=\"366\" x2=\"1034\" y2=\"366\" stroke=\"#D9822B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"972\" cy=\"366\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#D9822B\"></circle><circle cx=\"972\" cy=\"366\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D9822B\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><line x1=\"929\" y1=\"501\" x2=\"980\" y2=\"537\" stroke=\"#8C6500\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"></line><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"501\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#8C6500\"></circle><circle cx=\"929\" cy=\"501\" r=\"9.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8C6500\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"></circle><rect width=\"1280\" height=\"800\" filter=\"url(#eng)\" opacity=\".055\"></rect></svg><div class=\"ecl-core\" style=\"top:45.75%;\"> <div class=\"k\">Where they overlap</div> <div class=\"v\">The product lifecycle</div> <div class=\"c\">Ten stages</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"right:77.66%;top:24.38%;text-align:right;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#E0641E;\">01</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#E0641E;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Building Products and Assemblies</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"right:81.88%;top:45.75%;text-align:right;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#CC9900;\">02</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#CC9900;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Equipment, Machinery and Controls</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"right:77.66%;top:67.12%;text-align:right;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#C45213;\">03</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#C45213;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Engineered and Specialized Systems</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"left:77.66%;top:24.38%;text-align:left;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#B07E00;\">04</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#B07E00;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Off-Site and Industrialized Construction</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"left:81.88%;top:45.75%;text-align:left;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#D9822B;\">05</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#D9822B;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Sourcing, Supply and Fulfillment</div> </div><div class=\"ecl-lab\" style=\"left:77.66%;top:67.12%;text-align:left;\"> <div class=\"i\" style=\"color:#8C6500;\">06</div> <div class=\"r\" style=\"background:#8C6500;\"></div> <div class=\"t\">Product Support and Aftermarket</div> </div></div> <div class=\"ecl-fallback\"><div class=\"ecl-mini\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1280 800\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs> <radialGradient id=\"egm\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFFDF0\"></stop><stop offset=\".34\" stop-color=\"#F6E4A4\"></stop> <stop offset=\".72\" stop-color=\"#DFC15C\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#CC9900\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"eom\" cx=\"34%\" cy=\"30%\"> <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFF4E8\"></stop><stop offset=\".32\" stop-color=\"#FFB077\"></stop> <stop offset=\".70\" stop-color=\"#F2762A\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#E0641E\"></stop></radialGradient> <radialGradient id=\"ecm\"><stop offset=\".55\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,.20)\"></stop> <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"rgba(224,100,30,0)\"></stop></radialGradient> <filter id=\"engm\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"> <feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\"0.9\" numOctaves=\"4\" stitchTiles=\"stitch\"></feTurbulence> <feColorMatrix type=\"saturate\" values=\"0\"></feColorMatrix></filter> <clipPath id=\"elm\"><circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\"></circle></clipPath> </defs> <circle cx=\"544\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#egm)\"></circle> <circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"url(#eom)\" opacity=\".9\"></circle> <g clip-path=\"url(#elm)\"><circle cx=\"736\" cy=\"366\" r=\"236\" fill=\"#FFFBF0\" opacity=\".96\"></circle></g> </svg></div><ul class=\"ecl-list\"><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#E0641E;\">1</span><span class=\"t\">Building Products and Assemblies</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#CC9900;\">2</span><span class=\"t\">Equipment, Machinery and Controls</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#C45213;\">3</span><span class=\"t\">Engineered and Specialized Systems</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#B07E00;\">4</span><span class=\"t\">Off-Site and Industrialized Construction</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#D9822B;\">5</span><span class=\"t\">Sourcing, Supply and Fulfillment</span></li><li><span class=\"n\" style=\"background:#8C6500;\">6</span><span class=\"t\">Product Support and Aftermarket</span></li></ul></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Shared conditions</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Conditions shared across manufacturing</h2> <div class=\"grid2\"><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Demand tied to construction activity and project timing</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Products specified by designers and contractors before they are purchased</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Cost, capacity and commitments that move on shorter cycles</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Input costs and supplier lead times that change during an order</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Regional codes, standards and certification requirements</p></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;\">Configured and custom orders alongside standard product lines</p></div></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"band-warm\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Connected work</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Follow the product from demand to service</h2> <p class=\"lede\">A shift in project demand changes the production plan, material orders and delivery commitments. A supplier delay reaches the order book, the customer and the installation schedule. TwoSuns keeps cost, capacity and commitment connected across the teams that manage them.</p> <div class=\"grid4\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #9A7209;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#9A7209;\">Commercial</div><h3>Horizon</h3><p>Demand, customers, pricing and the product decisions that set what is worth making and for whom.</p></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #C45213;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#C45213;\">Operational</div><h3>Pulse</h3><p>Production performance, asset reliability, inventory and supplier coordination across the work that delivers it.</p></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #1E1A14;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#1E1A14;\">Foundation</div><h3>Core</h3><p>Products, plants, suppliers, orders and decisions held in one governed context.</p></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"border-top:4px solid #B8860B;\"><div class=\"dom-k\" style=\"color:#B8860B;\">Companion</div><h3>Ray</h3><p>Briefings, analysis and task support for commercial, production and supply teams.</p></div></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">In practice</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Representative workflows</h2> <p class=\"section-sub\">Configured from the same capabilities, around the work this industry actually runs.</p> <div class=\"grid2\"><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Manufacturing economics and production performance</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-manufacturing-economics-and-production-performance\">Read the workflow</a></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Product and research portfolio coordination</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-product-and-research-portfolio-coordination\">Read the workflow</a></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Procurement, inventory and supplier coordination</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-procurement-inventory-and-supplier-coordination\">Read the workflow</a></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;\">Executive planning and performance visibility</p><a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"use-cases.html#uc-executive-planning-and-performance-visibility\">Read the workflow</a></div></div> <a class=\"ev-more more-link\" href=\"use-cases.html\">Explore all use cases</a> <div class=\"callout\"><h3>Manufacturing</h3><p>Manufacturing is an active area of work rather than a published deployment. If you are running one, we would rather show you the platform against your own numbers than a reference from another sector.</p></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"band-alt\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"section-tag\">Industries</div> <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Connected across the built industry</h2> <div class=\"grid3\"><div class=\"card\"> <p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;\">Building Materials</p> <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;\">Producers run continuous plants against volatile inputs and commercial commitments that change week to week.</p> <a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"building-materials.html\">Explore this industry</a> </div><div class=\"card\"> <p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;\">Construction and Infrastructure</p> <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;\">Projects are won on estimates, delivered through changing conditions and judged long after handover.</p> <a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"construction.html\">Explore this industry</a> </div><div class=\"card\"> <p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;\">All Industries</p> <p style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;\">The three sectors we work in, and the six operating areas behind them.</p> <a class=\"ev-more\" href=\"industries.html\">See all industries</a> </div></div> </div> </section>\n\n<section class=\"cta-band\"> <div class=\"container\"> <h2>Start from your part of manufacturing</h2> <p>Tell us where your organization sits in manufacturing and the workflow you want to advance.</p> <div class=\"cta-actions\"><a class=\"btn-cta\" href=\"discuss.html?ask=Discuss+Your+Needs\">Discuss Your Needs</a> <a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"use-cases.html\">Explore Use Cases</a></div> </div> </section>"
}
